---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Now — Praweg Koirala" description="What Praweg Koirala is focused on right now.">
  <h1 class="mb-2 text-5xl font-extrabold tracking-[-0.02em]">Now</h1>
  <p class="mb-8 text-lg text-muted">What I'm focused on right now. <a href="https://nownownow.com" class="text-accent transition-colors hover:text-accent-hover hover:underline">Inspired by /now pages</a>.</p>

  <div class="grid gap-8">
    <div class="rounded-md border border-line bg-card p-8">
      <h2 class="mb-4 text-2xl font-bold">Building agentic AI pipelines</h2>
      <p class="text-muted">Working on a Kids Story Generator using Python + ADK + Gemini. Multi-agent orchestration to generate narrative, illustrations, and formatted output from a single prompt.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="rounded-md border border-line bg-card p-8">
      <h2 class="mb-4 text-2xl font-bold">Cloud infrastructure at prawegko.dev</h2>
      <p class="text-muted">Migrating my personal site to Astro, deploying via S3 + CloudFront with GitHub Actions OIDC. Learning the AWS-native deployment workflow.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="rounded-md border border-line bg-card p-8">
      <h2 class="mb-4 text-2xl font-bold">Automated trading scans</h2>
      <p class="text-muted">Running daily SPY/XSP bull put spread scans on Alpaca. Building toward semi-automated then fully automated execution.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="rounded-md border border-line bg-card p-8">
      <h2 class="mb-4 text-2xl font-bold">Being a new dad</h2>
      <p class="text-muted">Learning the ropes of fatherhood alongside building products. Currently operating on less sleep and more coffee.</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <p class="mt-16 text-sm text-muted"><em>Updated September 2026</em></p>
</BaseLayout>
